    "en": {
      "trackName": "Push Boxes: Logic Puzzle",
      "description": "Push boxes onto their targets. Sounds simple — until it isn't.\n11,814 levels, a cozy 3D warehouse, and not a single ad.\n\nPush Boxes is a classic Sokoban-style logic puzzle — one of the most elegant brain games ever invented. The rule is simple: you can only push, never pull. One wrong move and you've boxed yourself into a corner. Every level is a small, satisfying puzzle that rewards patience and planning, not luck or speed.\n\n11,814 LEVELS. ALL YOURS.\nFrom gentle warm-ups to fiendishly tricky brain-benders. Fewer than 20 players have ever solved more than 400 levels — think you can join them? Climb the Game Center leaderboard and aim for the Top 20.\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\n→ Unlimited undo — experiment freely, no penalty\n→ Night mode for late-night puzzling\n→ A cozy 3D warehouse with glowing boxes and a charming animated forklift\n\nONE GAME, EVERY APPLE DEVICE\nFive minutes on the bus or a long flight ahead — play on iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch and Apple TV. Your progress follows you everywhere.\n\nWHY YOU'LL LOVE IT\n→ No timers, no energy bars, no pressure — just pure logic\n→ Fully offline — no Wi-Fi needed, ever\n→ Buy once, play on all your Apple devices\n→ No ads. No subscriptions. No pay-to-win.\n\nJust you, a little forklift, and the boxes.",
      "releaseNotes": "New look! A cozy 3D warehouse, glowing boxes, night mode and a smoothly animated little forklift that brings every push to life.\n\nPush Boxes now speaks 20 languages! New: Turkish and Vietnamese, plus Brazilian Portuguese, Mexican Spanish, Canadian French, and UK and Australian English.\n\nThanks for playing!",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/push-boxes-logic-puzzle/id977326353?uo=4",
      "formattedPrice": "$3.99",
